OL,3,GNEWSAGirl who rescued injured boy from
OL,4,Abonfire acted 'on instinct'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 17-year-old girl who rescued an
OL,7,Finjured teenage boy from a bonfire said
OL,8,Fshe reacted on instinct.
OL,10,FThe boy, also 17, fell into the bonfire
OL,11,Fin Strabane, County Tyrone, after being
OL,12,Fknocked unconscious by a punch.
OL,14,FA local councillor, who spoke to his
OL,15,Fmother, said he had been left with
OL,16,F"severe burns" to his face and hands.
OL,18,FTianna Patterson said she saw him
OL,19,Fcollapse and fall into the fire and her
OL,20,Ffirst thought was to try to help.
